50:[$CC00C0]King Drein[$FFFFFF]: It'll be two days before he returns. I could have grabbed something to read.
51:[$CC00C0]King Drein[$FFFFFF]: :5_00144Please don't show up so suddenly.
52:Malcolm: Forgive me, but I told him I didn't like teleportation. However, we're pressed for time, so I didn't refuse him.
53:[$CC00C0]King Drein[$FFFFFF]: What exactly happened in Hanrain?
54:Malcolm: Just as Milo said. The kingdom is ruined, and Tyrio and Tamaio are dead. Probably the entire city population too.
55:[$CC00C0]King Drein[$FFFFFF]: By the goddess. 
56:Malcolm: Dyron went to Darin to talk to the fortune teller.
57:[$CC00C0]King Drein[$FFFFFF]: To that witch?
58:Malcolm: Don't judge people. Maybe she's different than you think.
59:[$CC00C0]King Drein[$FFFFFF]: I know better.
60:Malcolm: He also ordered us to gather an army and march through the tunnels to Valtaria.
61:[$CC00C0]King Drein[$FFFFFF]: The two of us are weak.
62:Malcolm: That's why you'll talk to Ratling; he can be trusted. I'll go to Citland and talk to Alan. 
63:[$CC00C0]King Drein[$FFFFFF]: He's an egoist, and a bigger one then you.
64:Malcolm: I told Dyron the same thing.
65:Malcolm: On my way back from the island, I'll visit Ethyria in Andaro; such a large army should be able to defeat Valtaria.
66:[$CC00C0]King Drein[$FFFFFF]: There's just one small problem. While we were fighting Kregor's army, our "Guest" was having a party. I heard from our spy Urno.
67:Malcolm: Urno was here?
68:[$CC00C0]King Drein[$FFFFFF]: Yes. But as quickly as he arrived, he disappeared. He only managed to say: "Every shipyard has been destroyed by the new enemy." No one will escape from Artidram.
69:Malcolm: He wants to imprison everyone in one continent:5_00142... But I have a feeling you know how to get to Citland:5_00150
70:[$CC00C0]King Drein[$FFFFFF]: You're right. There's a tunnel under the Herevel Sea that leads to the island.
71:Malcolm: Great... I'll be back in ten years?:5_00133
72:[$CC00C0]King Drein[$FFFFFF]: Maybe you'd better hurry up and do it in a few days.
73:Malcolm: Yes, majestic king:5_00134
74:[$CC00C0]King Drein[$FFFFFF]: Aghh!